- rate-limit auth and retry requests, coalesce concurrent refreshes, validate auth headers, parse HTTP-date retry delays, and harden pagination;
- represent deployment permission failures and unknown device filters explicitly instead of reporting false sync success;
- convert the live script into an opt-in hard-failing read-only pytest gate;
- test Python 3.10–3.13, enforce coverage, Ruff, strict mypy, Pyright, pre-commit, package build, clean-wheel import, registry smoke, and runtime dependency audit;
- add CodeQL, Dependabot, a security policy, decisions, current status, verification evidence, and project lifecycle governance;
- preserve the existing lab TLS default while requiring verification for production.

## Local proof

