The "Test on ubuntu-latest" CI job was failing due to two independent issues in `src/main.rs`.

## Changes

- **Formatting (`cargo fmt`)**: Several function signatures and macro calls were split across multiple lines unnecessarily (fit within the 100-char limit). `rustfmt` expected them collapsed to single lines.

- **Clippy (`manual_is_multiple_of`)**: Two modulo expressions were flagged as errors under `-D warnings`:

```rust
// Before
if data.len() % 46 != 0 { ... }
if size % 2 != 0 { ... }

// After
if !data.len().is_multiple_of(46) { ... }
if !size.is_multiple_of(2) { ... }
```

